WEBVTT

00:02.240 --> 00:07.840
Your AI is running. But do you really own it?

00:07.840 --> 00:14.840
Costs rise. Your data lives elsewhere. You're locked to one vendor.

00:14.840 --> 00:21.840
3cors brings it back onto your infrastructure. Three cores on one foundation.

00:21.840 --> 00:28.840
Three guarantees: cost control, data sovereignty, independence.

00:28.840 --> 00:33.016
3cors. Self-hosted, GDPR-ready. You own it.
